Zlyme vendors a working copy of NextUI until this fork is proven
and becomes its own repository. LoveRetro has no my355 tree; the
Miyoo Flip platform files under src/workspace/my355 started from
apommel/NextUI my355-latest (hardware map only) and are edited here.
SDCARD_PATH is /storage in platform.h — there is no path-rewriting
wrapper.

SSH, Samba, Syncthing, GPU, HDMI, and Backup live in Settings
(workspace/all/settings/zlymemenu.cpp), not as Tools paks.

